  "falsification": "A falsification test could involve comparing adherence to a randomly generated play mix or a historically common play mix (unconditional on suppression) against the suppression-conditional recommended mix. Another falsification is to check if 'adherence' predicts winning in prior seasons where the recommendation engine was not active or suppression conditions were not defined.",
