  "decision_rule": "Reject the null hypothesis (no effect of adherence on winning) if the p-value for the primary estimand is less than 0.05. However, given the identified risks, any statistically significant finding should be rigorously scrutinized for artifacts and robustness.",
  "data_version": "NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25 regular season and playoffs. NBA 2025-26 regular season and playoffs (complete as of 2026-06-21). This includes play-by-play, substitution, starters, defensive matchup, and box-score data."
 }
}

